  (text
    "SENSORS\nU8 SCD41 on +3V3: its 14 DNC pads aren't on the symbol, so they stay unconnected: pinout PASS.\nIts LCSC number is no longer listed: bom WARNING. I2C comes from the MCU sheet on a bus.\nU9 MT6701 encoder: its VDD is on +3V3_ENC, a rail meant to come from a load switch that was never\nfitted. Nothing drives it, so unpowered FAIL."
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top))
